## What WORKED (with evidence)

Verify trio at end of session: **tsc clean / 712 vitest (started 680, +32) / replay-pilot 30/30**. Every commit below ran the trio green before push.

- **SH12 rendered as v01 REVIEW** — confirmed by Supabase query + ffprobe; budget went 147.05 → 157 (~$9.40 incl. one failed 422 attempt). Anchor `bab5874f` approved, plan content patched (asset_id + quality_tier fast→standard for 1080p), fire with explicit `planAssetId`.
- **Animatic v07 regen** — confirmed by `metadata.animatic_v1.shot_list.length === 30`, btn01..btn30 ↔ SH01..SH30 1-в-1.
- **`065fb89` fail-loud guard** — `assertCompleteShotList` in `animatic-shotlist.ts`; +5 unit tests; replaces 2 legacy `shotList.length === 0` checks; future silent drop throws with missing shot_ids list.
- **`92f05df` Critic reads Series Bible** — Critic now loads `loadSeriesBibleCanon` + injects `formatBibleForPrompt` block into user message; Director's LOCKED `SBL-general_idea` standing orders propagate to Critic (Animator already did). +2 tests assert canon string appears in user message.
- **`85359ef` UI version label** — caption shows `v0X STATUS` pill (green APPROVED, amber REVIEW); popover marks current playing version with ▶ + «on screen» label. No new state — pulled from existing `vidShotsByShotId` map.
- **`ed89795` stitch /api/media/ URL fix** — `loadBytes` in `runner.ts:2519` now resolves `/api/media/{filename}` via `cachedFileIfPresent` (parallel to existing `/staging/` branch). Closes «Online Editor failed — Failed to parse URL» that crashed on stale animatic music URL.
- **`3290cc2` atomic 4-in-1** — `computeTotalDuration` accepts `clipLengths` Map; AnimaticPlayer shows honest duration; EXEC-STITCH skips shots with `effective ≤ 0.5s` + reports `excluded_shot_ids` in metadata; AudioTrack gains `fade_in/out/trim_in/trim_out`; `buildMusicAudioFilter` extracted as pure export (+7 tests); `-shortest` replaced with explicit `-t totalVideoSeconds` (closes «конец как обрыв»); ffprobe sets `durationSeconds` on VID-final_cut metadata.
- **`c4f2f2a` + `afdbe1f` head trim + playback skip** — `AnimaticDirectorOverride.trim_start_seconds`; ffmpeg `inpoint <s>` directive (with `outpoint = inpoint + duration` math + +4 tests); `<video>` element sync now seeks to `trim_start + inCellOffset` so preview matches final cut; `playStart` coord-space added so excluded shots are skipped in playback (not just final cut); `computeEffectivePlayback` consolidates duration/trim/clip-length math (+3 tests).
- **`9d29309` music server-side pre-process on Save** — `music-processor.ts` (new helper, ~80 LoC) wraps `buildMusicAudioFilter` + `runFfmpeg`; `/animatic-timing` PATCH writes processed mp3 to media-cache and rewrites `track.url` to `*-processed.mp3` so `<audio>` plays the same shaped audio EXEC-STITCH will mux; `AudioTrack.original_url` bookkeeping lets shaping be cleared cleanly. +5 tests.
- **Cloud schedule `hourly-context`** — created via `mcp__scheduled-tasks__create_scheduled_task`; cron `7 * * * *`; survives session close.

